  are included. Remote and unknown dependencies fail closed. All `map_*` PBR
  extensions and CRLF OBJ `mtllib` lines are covered.
- Runtime provenance formerly decoded and `shlex`-parsed every geometry line
  in every OBJ. On the real asset tree that consumed one CPU for more than nine
  minutes without completing. It now memory-maps the OBJ and strictly decodes
  only anchored `mtllib` directives; irrelevant geometry bytes are never
  interpreted as shell syntax. Empty or invalid-UTF8 directives still fail
  closed.
