  1 expected DeFM skip;
- broad PPO/student/eval/resume/RNG/seed/safe-loader/provenance/inference/ONNX
  suite with both source roots active: 667 passed, 1 expected skip;
- complete launcher contracts: PASS;
- Python compilation, shell syntax, `git diff --check`, and the exact staged
  list passed.

Two real-process CPU/Gloo harnesses exercised both the WORLD-gradient and
secondary-Gloo control planes.  A single-rank NaN loss, clip failure,
optimizer failure, optimizer-state Inf, teacher-rollout Inf, selector
exception, pre-env Inf action, model-buffer NaN, and streamed microbatch
