tensor was still multiplied by an exact zero PPO coefficient.  That produces
a material zero gradient for a trainable Gaussian `std`; AdamW can then create
optimizer state and apply decoupled weight decay even though PPO and explicit
std matching are both inactive.  In pure BC, entropy is now a detached
diagnostic.  `dagger_match_std` remains the only intentional supervised std
