2026-07-19 state-robust privileged-teacher correction and relaunch
===================================================================

The earlier `toxsjobi` teacher used the broad
`g1_29dof_wbt_w_object_with_action_delay` preset. That mixed a useful motion
tracking objective with sim-to-real effects that are not wanted for the label
teacher, and its checkpoint publisher reset all 65,536 live environments after
each save. The exact `priv_teacher_r30_ws64_toxsjobi` sessions were stopped on
all eight nodes only after their process ancestry and immutable source cwd had
been verified. The protected r30 student runs `q9qn6xb9`, `b72gh1wx`, and
`5utvhw89` were not touched.

Reset-order bug and teacher randomization contract
--------------------------------------------------

Code inspection found that the old DOF-state randomizer did not affect WBT
motion resets. `BaseTask.reset_envs_idx()` called the randomization manager
before the command manager; `MotionCommand.reset()` then overwrote the
randomized joint state with the motion reference. A new
`MotionRelativeResetRandomizerState` validates and exposes the preset, while
the final `MotionCommand` state write now applies the effective noise. The
motion initial-pose contract also gained DOF-velocity noise.

The new `g1_29dof_wbt_w_object_teacher_state_robust` preset contains only:

* joint position +/-0.20 rad and joint velocity +/-0.35 rad/s;
* root position +/-[0.08, 0.08, 0.025] m and rotation
  +/-[0.15, 0.15, 0.30] rad;
* root linear velocity +/-[0.20, 0.20, 0.10] m/s and angular velocity
  +/-[0.25, 0.25, 0.35] rad/s;
* object position +/-[0.08, 0.08, 0.0] m; object z remains exact to avoid
  injecting spawn penetration;
* bounded recovery pushes every 4--8 seconds with maximum absolute velocity
  [0.25, 0.25, 0.10, 0.20, 0.20, 0.30].

It deliberately contains no action delay, PD/KD gain, RFI, motor-strength,
mass/COM/inertia, friction/material, joint-sensor bias, camera-pose, depth
multiplicative-noise, or depth-dropout term. The published W&B config was
independently read back and its randomization tree contains only the
motion-relative reset state, push state/schedule, and push application terms.
The exact contract has SHA256
`6477e9657a1d635dc287350972fe2f88139c523a02b6c7e46504ced9031960f3`.

Checkpoint publication now defaults to preserving the live rollout stream.
`reset_rollout_at_checkpoint=false` is explicit in the formal CLI and W&B
config. A normal checkpoint at each positive multiple of 1000 iterations no
longer resets every environment. The canonical reset logged at iteration zero
is the one-time fresh-training rollout initialization and is not a save-time
reset. An opt-in true value remains available only for experiments that
explicitly require the old canonical-reset semantics.

