Rollout difference and action-label gate
----------------------------------------

The new rollouts are not copies of the u8 result. Aligned-frame luminance SSIM
for ball/bin/barrel is 0.706108 / 0.706753 / 0.675360 (all-channel SSIM
0.803372 / 0.803774 / 0.782855), and manual side-by-side sheets show altered
