An offline actor comparison used the authenticated u8 rollout
`actor_obs_norm` sequences. Re-evaluating the old actor reproduced its stored
actions with maximum error below `9.54e-6`. On those identical physical states,
old versus new action-L2 means were 8.53/8.33 (ball), 7.36/7.90 (bin), and
7.74/8.51 (barrel); new-versus-old per-component RMSE was 1.324/1.091/1.181.
