still look stable because the environment clips torques, while current raw-MSE
distillation labels are not torque-equivalence projected and
`clip_teacher_actions` is false. Therefore the checkpoint identity is selected
for the next fresh cross-teacher distillation, but raw label quality is not
declared scientifically accepted from video alone. Before launching a new
student, the action acceptance/projection contract must be explicit and tested
on student-state rollouts. This is central to the user's earlier action-label
concern, not a cosmetic follow-up.

